# Working design notes, kept out of the repository rather than out of the project.
# They document SigenStorDisplay's API contract and auth scheme in detail, and that
# product has not been released — so publishing this repository would publish its
# interface. Both files stay on disk and every "see PLAN.md §x" in the source still
# resolves locally; they are simply not shipped. Keep a copy somewhere durable: a
# fresh clone will not bring them back.
CLAUDE.md
docs/PLAN.md

